{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}Tree — {{ project.title }}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}

<h1>Project tree</h1>
<p class="muted">
  Every item in the project, filed by the containment spine: workspace,
  board, <code>part_of</code> group, item. An item with several groups is
  expanded once, under its first group by id, and listed as a reference
  under the others. Items with no board and no group sit in
  <strong>Project-wide</strong>, rendered last. Nothing here is hidden:
  the counts are the whole project.
</p>

{{ tree_html | safe }}

{% endblock %}
